style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"38\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"110\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">잔여기간</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"></span>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4.</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 설문조사 실시<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 조사방법 : 전구간 예약기간 9월 19일(월)~21(수) 3일 운행 후<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;9월 22일(목)에 설문조사를 실시<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 조사반영 : 설문조사 결과를 통학버스운행에 적극 반영</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 도서관 예약기계 터치 스크린 고장<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 고장원인 : 도서관 1층 로비에 설치된 예약기계의 터치 스크린<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">고장은&nbsp;설치업체에서는 이용자가 터치 스크린를 예리<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;한 칼 또는 송곳으로 스크린을 그어서 고장원인<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;되었다고 하오니 이용자들도 기구가 아닌 손으로<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;스크린을 터치하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 고장수리 : 9월 15일(목) 15시경 터치 스크린(모니터) 교체</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">학&nbsp; 생&nbsp; 처</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n     